 "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199018614738/", "num_games_owned": 158, "num_reviews": 104, "playtime_forever": 9938, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1, "playtime_at_review": 9619, "last_played": 1787659325, "avatar": "73082650c79592f566efc3d8f475b84832bb990c"}, "language": "russian", "review": "Маленькие дети, ни за что на свете\nНе ходите в Deep Dive Elite гулять\nВ Deep Dive Elite акулы (слешеры)\nВ Deep Dive Elite гориллы (претеоранцы)\nВ Deep Dive Elite большие крокодилы (дредноуты)\nБудут вас кусать, бить и обижать\nНе ходите дети в Deep Dive Elite гулять\nВ Deep Dive Elite разбойник (немезис)\nВ Deep Dive Elite злодей (корлок)\nВ Deep Dive Elite ужасный БАР-МА-ЛЕЙ (детонатор)", "timestamp_created": 1699465031, "timestamp_updated": 1782915407, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149768355", "author": {"steamid": "76561199231358539", "personaname": "Shtativ4ik2", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ANEZNAY/", "num_games_owned": 165, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 6435, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1770, "last_played": 1761991481, "avatar": "b963a5e65e2b474c5cbb743c33b113f54658d5e8"}, "language": "russian", "review": "я ♥♥♥♥ в жопу этих ваших пауков", "timestamp_created": 1699464595, "timestamp_updated": 1699464595, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494208484888076782", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "149766543", "author": {"steamid": "765611988425812